                    27 VIET S. Top Secret; Immediate; Nodis; Eyes
                    Only. Drafted by McGeorge Bundy and
                    initialed and approved by Rusk.
                    Transmitted as telegram 2087 to Saigon, which is the source text.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d181-f2" n="2" xml:id="d181-f2-content">
